 "zy-1-line_xiang-6", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "line_xiang", "line": 6, "text": "“亢龙有悔”，盈不可久也。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "乾·上九小象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:line_xiang:6"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "“亢龙有悔”，盈不可久也。"}, {"id": "zy-2-judgment", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "judgment", "line": null, "text": "元亨，利牝马之贞。君子有攸往，先迷，后得主，利。西南得朋，东北丧朋。安贞吉。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/iching/iching.json", "locator": "坤·卦辞", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:judgment"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "元亨，利牝马之贞。君子有攸往，先迷，后得主，利。西南得朋，东北丧朋。安贞吉。"}, {"id": "zy-2-xiang", "hexagramId": 2, "name": "坤", "section": "xiang", "line": null, "text": "地势坤，君子以厚德载物。", "source": "https://github.com/john-walks-slow/open-iching/blob/4c5f00f8cb62c6e0d2471243d28150b473ef592f/ichuan/xiang.json", "locator": "坤·大象", "version": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62-v2", "review": "版本已固定，结构已验证；文字未完成逐条人工校勘", "layer": "classic", "workId": "zhouyi", "workTitle": "周易", "sourceId": "open-iching-4c5f00f8cb62", "editionId": "open-iching-v2", "editionLabel": "Open I Ching 固定快照（未逐条校勘）", "authorIds": [], "authorNames": [], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:02:xiang"], "commentsOn": [], "reviewStatus": "legacy_unreviewed", "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "textOriginal": "地势坤，君子以厚德载物。"}, {"id": "wang-bi@2676007:h1:line3:77e8edd366", "hexagramId": 1, "name": "乾", "section": "line", "line": 3, "text": "處下體之極，居上體之下，在不中之位，履重剛之險。上不在天，未可以安其尊也。下不在田，未可以甯其居也。純脩下道，則居上之德廢；純脩上道，則處下之禮曠。故「終日乾乾」，至於夕惕猶若厲也。居上不驕，在下不憂，因時而惕，不失其幾，雖危而勞，可以「無咎」。處下卦之極，愈於上九之亢，故竭知力而後免於咎也。乾三以處下卦之上，故免亢龍之悔。坤三以處下卦之上，故免龍戰之災。", "textOriginal": "處下體之極，居上體之下，在不中之位，履重剛之險。上不在天，未可以安其尊也。下不在田，未可以甯其居也。純脩下道，則居上之德廢；純脩上道，則處下之禮曠。故「終日乾乾」，至於夕惕猶若厲也。居上不驕，在下不憂，因時而惕，不失其幾，雖危而勞，可以「無咎」。處下卦之極，愈於上九之亢，故竭知力而後免於咎也。乾三以處下卦之上，故免亢龍之悔。坤三以處下卦之上，故免龍戰之災。", "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%A8%E6%98%93%E6%AD%A3%E7%BE%A9/01%E4%B9%BE&oldid=2676007", "locator": "《周易正義》·乾·第3爻注", "version": "ws-2676007", "review": "机器规则提取，已保留来源与边界；未经人工校勘，异文未擅改", "reviewStatus": "machine_parsed", "layer": "commentary", "workId": "zhouyi-zhengyi", "workTitle": "周易正義", "sourceId": "ws-2676007", "editionId": "ws-zhouyi-zhengyi", "editionLabel": "维基文库通行电子文本（底本未逐页核验）", "authorIds": ["wang-bi"], "authorNames": ["王弼"], "anchorIds": ["zhouyi:01:line:3"], "commentsOn": ["zhouyi:01:line:3"], "releaseId": "knowledge-v3-20260926-r1", "rawLocator": {"file": "data/knowledge/raw/ws-2676007.wiki", "startLine": 26, "endLine": 26, "pageLabels": []}}], "scopeIds": [1, 2], "targets": [{"hexagramId": 1, "section": "special", "line": 7, "layer": "classic"}], "requireCitations": true, "nextStep": "route", "intent": "source_request", "durationMs": 22, "eventId": 1, "timestamp": "2026-10-10T11:35:13.935747+00:00", "caseId": "dev-32", "variant": "B"}
